<title>USA: Nyer Medical subsidiary files for IPO.</title>
<headline>Nyer Medical subsidiary files for IPO.</headline>
<dateline>BANGOR, Maine 1996-09-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Nyer Medical Group Inc said Monday its subsidiary, Genetic Vectors Inc has filed a registration statement with the Securities and Exchange Commission covering the proposed initial public offering of 400,000 shares of Vectors' common stock at an anticipated public offering price of $10.00 per share.</p>
</text>
